{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100928","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100928/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100928/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100928/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100928","id":2763309357,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6ktMEt","number":100928,"title":"Getters and setters returning wild values","user":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-12-30T14:46:32Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T19:28:04Z","closed_at":"2024-12-30T18:03:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nNewest MacOS on Mac Mini M1\n\n### Issue description\n\nValues of setters and getters produce wild values under certain circumstances.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MRP.\nConfirm the only code in the project is in the base model of the item:\n\n```\nextends Node2D\n\n@export var item_worth : float = 10:\n\tset(new_v): # new value\n\t\titem_worth = new_v\n\t\ta_prices.gold_total += item_worth\n\t\tprint(\"New total: \", a_prices.gold_total)\n```\n\nOpen the \"room\" scene, and click on the items (white rectangles) and confirm in the inspector their values are 10 and 100.\n\n(At this point… Can you guess what is the total gold value you'll get after running the example?\nI'd expect no output whatsoever, because I set the values in the editor and this should not trigger the setter at all. Next logical expectation would be that the total value would be 110 since that's what the items have in their \"item_worth\", 100+10 = 110, but this is also not going to happen.)\n\nRun the example and check the console.\nThe total value you'll get from the two items is 140!\n\nTo me this looks like a bug, but I expect the explanation behind this behavior will be that the values entered in the editor are applied when the game is run (including the modification to the base model). This is, however, not expected at all in this context unless you know it in advance. Im sure there are other reasons why it acts like this, but I was not able to find it mentioned anywhere in the docs. If this is a feature, it should at least be clarified somewhere in the docs.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[engage-funny-setter-geter.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18275416/engage-funny-setter-geter.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"inhalt120g","id":106015575,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlGrVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106015575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g","html_url":"https://github.com/inhalt120g","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/inhalt120g/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100928/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1009